## What I changed

**`src/paginate.ts`**
- Added validation: throws `RangeError` if `page` isn't a positive integer, and a separate `RangeError` if `perPage` isn't a positive integer.
- Fixed the offset: `start = (page - 1) * perPage` so page 1 starts at index 0.
- `pageCount` left unchanged.

**`src/paginate.test.ts`**
- Imports `paginate` alongside `pageCount`; kept the existing `pageCount` test.
- Added tests: page 1 → first items, last page → remainder, page past end → `[]`, page 0 / negative page throw, perPage 0 / negative perPage throw. All use `expect(() => ...).toThrow(RangeError)`.

